text to scene: Code generator using intermidiate representation IR 

obj -> create_geometry() -> vertices/indices/colors
    -> generateSmoothNormalsMesh(...)
    -> RenderMesh / VertexArray / Shader

files: 
textToScene/src/
    code_generation.py Includes the main code for creating
    a executable scpript in python.
    ir_schema.py contains the ir in json format which is used is
    as input to code_generation.
    main.py a file that indicates the pipeline for the text to code \
    generation
    text_parser.py
    
textTOScene/data 

textToScene/tests



Addjust to a better solution 
The idea:
scene is not just a list of objects but a tree with nodes.
The initial nodes are:
    - scene
    - group
    - mesh_object
    - camera
    - light

    
